Package: scmr
Title: Spatially Clustered Multinomial Regression
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bayu", "Suseno", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "byususen@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person("SCMR study contributors", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Implements spatially clustered multinomial regression (SCMR) and
    global penalized multinomial regression benchmarks for multiclass
    categorical outcomes with spatial heterogeneity. The package supports ridge,
    lasso, and elastic-net penalties, user-specified alpha and lambda values,
    user-controlled numbers of spatial clusters, feasible initialization, and
    synthetic-data simulation scripts for reproducible methodological studies.
    No private real data are distributed.
